"><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ptapmdeg#En1466Ph13Ad1" /><aaif:text> porque matam ... uma violência mesmo ... mas ele tem que morrer</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> porque matam ... uma violência [a|mesmo|mesmo|aunnsnnn] ... mas ele tem que morrer</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ptapmdeg#En1466Ph13Ad1"><aaif:text>mesmo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mesmo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Noun" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Specification" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ptapmdeg#En1466Ph14"><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ptapmdeg#En1466Ph14Ad1" /><aaif:text> se realmente a pessoa fosse condenada a trinta ... quarenta anos de cadeia</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> se [a|realmente|real|muSndnnn] a pessoa fosse condenada a trinta ... quarenta anos de cadeia</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ptapmdeg#En1466Ph14Ad1"><aaif:text>realmente</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#real" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSche