/gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ptapmdeg#En1478Ph25Ad1" /><aaif:text> porque a vontade de Deus pra gente é totalmente diferente dessa realidade que tá aí</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> porque a vontade de Deus pra gente é [a|totalmente|total|muanqnnn] diferente dessa realidade que tá aí</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ptapmdeg#En1478Ph25Ad1"><aaif:text>totalmente</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#total" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#mente" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ptapmdeg#En1478Ph26"><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ptapmdeg#En1478Ph26Ad1" /><aaif:text> o que ele ... que ele quer mesmo ... é que a gente tenha uma vida</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> o que ele ... que ele quer [a|mesmo|mesmo|auSnsnnn] ... é que a gente tenha uma vida</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ptapmdeg#En1478Ph26Ad1"><aaif:text>mesmo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mesmo" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif