ue era legal de\/ que só ... era de tartaruga</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> tinha um que era legal de\/ que [a|só|só|aunnsnnn] ... era de tartaruga</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ptapmdeg#En1598Ph6Ad1"><aaif:text>só</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#só" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Noun" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Specification" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ptapmdeg#En1598Ph7"><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ptapmdeg#En1598Ph7Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ptapmdeg#En1598Ph7Ad2" /><aaif:text>  só que o (dinei ol) tá muito chato agora</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>  [a|só|só|auSnsnnn] que o (dinei ol) tá [a|muito|muito|auanqnnn] chato agora</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ptapmdeg#En1598Ph7Ad1"><aaif:text>só</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#só" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:c